Right-click > 檢查這一頁, or the 頁面 view's title bar > 檢查所有頁面 (WPF:
the Error List): the results go to the Problems panel (a click opens the
line; a checked page is checked again while it changes).
- quote-cut (error): an attribute value closed early by a quote of its own
  kind -- the generator writes style="…font-family:"MS Sans Serif",
  sans-serif;font-weight:400;" (also font:12pt "MS Sans Serif"); the browser
  stops at font-family: and drops the font and all after it. Measured: 297
  on 21 pages (Alert.Note 93, Setup.SCK_ART 54, HW.home 34 ...). Fix: the
  bulb in the HTML (this one / the whole page), or right-click > 修正這一頁
  所有被切斷的屬性 in the designer: the inner quotes become the other kind,
  one Ctrl+Z, not saved. (Web author's files: sync_web.py --apply overwrites
  them; the real fix belongs in _gen_dfm_abs.py.)
- dup-id (error), unclosed (an element with an id without its end tag),
  missing (<img> / <script> / <link> naming a file that is not there).
- lib/pagelint.js; htmlblock.elementRange now goes straight to the end tag
  of a <script> / <style> (their "a < b" is not markup -- the lint first
  reported the two Alert.MotionView helper scripts as unclosed).

Tests: lib 124 (HotPlate's one cut style, the fix keeps font-weight:400;
dup-id / unclosed / missing; a script's "<" ; cutValues), smoke 100 (the
Problems panel: line 56; the bulb's two actions; all pages: 297 on 22),
real VS Code 102 (the real Problems panel; VS Code offers our fix; fix all:
the quotes single, the problem gone; one undo), probe, panels -- all pass.

